---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Liva 2.3 — Tooling completion · Blog" description="REPL, doc generator, bench runner, coverage, Jest hooks. Notes from the v2.3 release.">
  <Nav />

  <main class="min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 prose-liva">
      <p class="section-num text-[color:var(--color-ink-3)] mb-4">
        <a href="/blog" class="hover:text-[color:var(--color-accent)] transition-colors">← blog</a>
      </p>

      <div class="font-mono-tight text-[12px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-3)] mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
        2026-05-21 · release · tooling
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight leading-[1.05] mb-6">
        Liva 2.3 — Tooling completion
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)] text-[17px] leading-relaxed mb-10">
        The compiler grew up two releases ago. v2.3 closes the gap on the
        tooling so the day-to-day experience matches.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4">What shipped</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-[15px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)]">
        <li><code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">livac repl</code> — interactive read-eval-print loop, history-aware (rustyline).</li>
        <li><code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">livac doc</code> — Markdown reference generated from <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">///</code> doc-comments.</li>
        <li><code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">livac bench</code> — one <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">BENCH … ms</code> line per <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">bench_*</code> function; CI bench gate available.</li>
        <li><code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">livac test --coverage</code> — wired into <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">cargo-llvm-cov</code>, emits LCOV ready for Codecov.</li>
        <li>Jest-style <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">beforeEach</code> / <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">afterEach</code> hooks.</li>
        <li>Lazy iterator chain fusion (<code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">.map().filter().reduce()</code> collapses into a single loop).</li>
        <li><code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">LIVA_STRICT=1</code> env var to fail on any warning.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4">Why a REPL took us until 2.3</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Because we cheated. The REPL doesn’t interpret Liva — every line gets
        wrapped into a synthetic <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">main()</code>,
        codegened to Rust, and run via <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">cargo run</code>.
        It works because incremental Rust builds are fast and we cache the
        previous Rust crate as a "session". Felt wrong, ships great.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4">CI</h2>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        We committed a seed binary at
        <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">bootstrap/seed/livac-linux-amd64</code>
        to bypass intermittent BS-FRAG bugs during bootstrap. CI is fully
        green again. Tag <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-[color:var(--color-paper-2)] font-mono-tight text-[13px]">v2.3.0</code>
        pushed, installers building cross-platform.
      </p>

      <hr class="hairline my-12" />

      <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono-tight text-[13px]">
        <a href="/changelog" class="text-[color:var(--color-ink-2)] hover:text-[color:var(--color-accent)] transition-colors">
          ← full changelog
        </a>
        <a href="/install" class="text-[color:var(--color-accent)] link-anim">
          install →
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
